@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Score ALTO (~427) — poucas transações pagas em dia, uma atrasada e uma inadimplente
POST {{baseUrl}}/credit-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": { "id": "u1", "name": "Ana" },
  "transactions": [
    { "id": "t1", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-01", "paidDate": "2024-01-01", "status": "paid" },
    { "id": "t2", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-02", "status": "late" },
    { "id": "t3", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-03", "status": "unpaid" }
  ]
}

### Score MÉDIO (~603) — maioria paga em dia, uma transação atrasada
POST {{baseUrl}}/credit-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": { "id": "u2", "name": "Bruno" },
  "transactions": [
    { "id": "t1", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-01", "paidDate": "2024-01-01", "status": "paid" },
    { "id": "t2", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-02", "paidDate": "2024-01-02", "status": "paid" },
    { "id": "t3", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-03", "status": "late" }
  ]
}

### Score BAIXO (~840) — histórico totalmente pago em dia, bom volume
POST {{baseUrl}}/credit-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": { "id": "u3", "name": "Carla" },
  "transactions": [
    { "id": "t1", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-01", "paidDate": "2024-01-01", "status": "paid" },
    { "id": "t2", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-02", "paidDate": "2024-01-02", "status": "paid" },
    { "id": "t3", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-03", "paidDate": "2024-01-03", "status": "paid" },
    { "id": "t4", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-04", "paidDate": "2024-01-04", "status": "paid" }
  ]
}

### Score MUITO ALTO (~150) — todas as transações inadimplentes
POST {{baseUrl}}/credit-score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": { "id": "u4", "name": "Diego" },
  "transactions": [
    { "id": "t1", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-01", "status": "unpaid" },
    { "id": "t2", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-02", "status": "unpaid" },
    { "id": "t3", "amount": 100, "dueDate": "2024-01-03", "status": "unpaid" }
  ]
}

